              "lastPrayed": "2026-10-04T06:45:17.442097Z",
              "seenCount": 2,
              "isMarkdown": false
            },
            {
              "text": "God intensely and righteously protects his own honor and the exclusive worship of his people, desiring their ultimate good and supreme devotion.",
              "ordering": 0,
              "createdDate": "2026-09-09T12:56:39.693874Z",
              "stackGroup": "69df53e4-5894-4673-8f6c-371001fcf741",
