          "priorityLevel": 0,
          "schedulingMode": 0,
          "seenCount": 5,
          "cards": [
            {
              "text": "Romans 11:33-34\n\nOh, the depth of the riches and wisdom and knowledge of God!\nHow unsearchable are his judgments and how inscrutable his\nways! “For who has known the mind of the Lord, or who has been\nhis counselor?”",
              "ordering": 0,
              "createdDate": "2026-08-27T13:01:59.978571Z",
              "stackGroup": "b0fc755d-c4f2-4c9b-8db9-856b3aafd2db",
