              "eventReminder": false,
              "lastPrayed": "2026-10-14T05:54:44.699097Z",
              "seenCount": 4,
              "isMarkdown": false
            },
            {
              "text": "Psalm 139:1-4\n\nO LORD, you have searched me and known me! You know when I\nsit down and when I rise up; you discern my thoughts from afar.\nYou search out my path and my lying down and are acquainted\nwith all my ways. Even before a word is on my tongue, behold, O\nLORD, you know it altogether.",
              "ordering": 0,
              "createdDate": "2026-08-27T13:01:27.964701Z",
              "stackGroup": "1c2e44cd-64c8-415c-b4a8-4296ff8ff508",
              "threadId": "7ed291e5-5191-4b12-84a6-3ec7b36d10ed",
              "archived": false,
              "stackOrder": -1,
              "eventReminder": false,
              "lastPrayed": "2026-10-14T05:54:44.700511Z",
              "seenCount": 4,
              "isMarkdown": false
            },
            {
              "text": "God possesses all knowledge, knowing all there is to know\nwhether actual or possible.",
              "ordering": 0,
              "createdDate": "2026-08-27T13:01:00.754751Z",
              "stackGroup": "c603e922-e489-4259-8511-67edd25d9211",
              "threadId": "6fca095a-06d1-4e60-9350-6be43dff9bb3",
              "archived": false,
              "stackOrder": 0,
